    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29183" root="عشب" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَلَدٌ عَاشِبٌ</span></b>  (S, A, O) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعْشِبٌ</span></b> , (A,) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْضِعٌ عَاشِبٌ</span> (Msb) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكَانٌ عَشِيبٌ</span></b> , (S, O,)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَوْضٌ عَاشِبٌ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعْشِبٌ</span></b> , (TA,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاشِبَةٌ</span> (Msb, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَشِيبَةٌ</span></b>  (S, O, Msb, K) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَشِبَةٌ</span></b>  (Msb, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعْشِبَةٌ</span></b> , (S, Msb,) but
some do not say ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَشِيبٌ</span></b> , (Msb,) [<i>A country,</i> and
<i>a place,</i> and <i>meadows,</i> and <i>land,</i>] <i>having,</i> or <i>producing,</i> [<i>herbs,</i> or <i>herbage, of the kind termed</i>]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُشْب</span>, (S, A, O, Msb,) or <i>much thereof.</i> (K. [See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِعْشَابٌ</span>.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَعِيرٌ عَاشِبٌ</span> <i>A camel feeding upon</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُشْب</span>. (S, O.)

